event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":87,"item_id":"rs_0123a7d864a31cf3016aca0927a70081978c5670a3d12adac6","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing alert changes**\n\nI'm thinking about creating a general alert for server changes and any errors that might occur. It seems important to ensure that these alerts are concise so I can convey the necessary information clearly. If the alert goes off, it should grab attention quickly without overwhelming details. I want to make sure I'm covering all the bases here, allowing for easy understanding and quick reactions when needed. Overall, I think this will improve server management."}

